From: openEuler RISC-V packaging
Subject: [PATCH] Bound numeric parsing and close command pipes on every path
SPDX-License-Identifier: ISC

Original downstream static review of Libgeome 1.0. Check that each numeric
conversion consumed input, reset errno per conversion, use unsigned ctype
arguments, bound timezone coordinate indexing, and make command-output
cleanup and limits explicit. Wait only for the owned child, retry EINTR.
No build target, original driver, public API or optional service is removed.
Not submitted upstream. Remove after an official release has equivalent
fixes and passes the unchanged original drivers plus these regressions.

